  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a></p><p>Better 3D Beds 透過為所有床鋪引入改進的 3D 模型，徹底改變了 Minecraft 中的睡眠體驗。此材質包以更細緻且逼真的設計取代了舊有的 2D 模型，提供了更令人愉悅的視覺體驗。每張床現在都具備立體外觀，增添了深度與細節，從而提升了遊戲的整體美感。</p><p>主要變更：<br>- 所有床鋪的全新細緻 3D 模型<br>- 更逼真且具沉浸感的外觀<br>- 以立體設計取代舊有的 2D 模型</p><p>使用 Better 3D Beds，Minecraft 中的床鋪從未如此舒適與優雅。此材質包非常適合希望在遊戲世界中增添一絲真實感與美感的玩家。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></p>",
